# Python environments
venv/
.venv/

# Python cache & artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Working notes, design docs, scratch writing. Deliberately OUTSIDE docs/:
# app/ingestion/ingest.py globs docs/ recursively, so anything left there
# becomes retrievable RAG content. docs/ is the sample corpus the demo answers
# from, not a place for project documentation.
notes/

# Same rule, different filenames. These declare themselves deliberately
# untracked, but "untracked" is not a property a file keeps on its own -- a
# single `git add -A` commits them. The repository-voice rule in CLAUDE.md
# says demo scripts, interview material and session narratives must not reach
# the tracked repo, so it is enforced here rather than left to whoever types
# the next add.
DEMO.md
AUTOPLAN-REVIEW-*.md
# Interview handbook: JD mappings, talking points, CV phrasing. Exactly the
# category the repository-voice rule names, and 56KB of it -- the single most
# important file in this list to keep out of a public repo.
PROJECT_HANDBOOK.md
# Working plan, and the design-canvas exports behind the UI redesign. Neither
# describes the system as it is; both would read as stale the day after they
# were written.
FIX_PLAN.md
design/
# Claude Code session transcripts dropped in the repo root by --continue.
2???-??-??-*.txt

# FastEmbed model cache (baked into the Docker image at build time instead --
# see Dockerfile; this is just the local dev equivalent)
.fastembed_cache/
.flashrank_cache/

# Files real visitors uploaded, left behind by local runs and by fetching a
# staged upload down from GCS. Untracked already, but that was doing no work
# here: .gcloudignore is `#!include:.gitignore`, so anything absent from this
# file goes into the tarball `gcloud builds submit` uploads to the CD source
# bucket -- meaning other people's documents were being shipped to GCS on
# every build. .dockerignore's `docs/` kept them out of the image; nothing
# kept them out of the build context.
docs/uploads/

# Logs & eval outputs
logs/
*.log
eval_results.json
ragas_results.json

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
